      "html": "<div class=\"x-text x-text-headline e1147-e9 mvv-g mvv-h\"><div class=\"x-text-content\"><div class=\"x-text-content-text\"><p class=\"x-text-content-text-primary\">Hunter McAreavy</p><span class=\"x-text-content-text-subheadline\">DDS</span></div></div></div><div class=\"x-text x-content e1147-e10 mvv-k\"><p class=\"p1\">Dr. Hunter is very excited to begin serving patients at Cosmetic &amp; Implant Dentistry WP!<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp; </span>Dr. Hunter is from a small town in Missouri and recently moved back from Colorado after living there for 7 years.<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp; </span>She completed her Bachelor of Science from the University of Missouri, and Doctor of Dental Surgery (DDS) at the University of Missouri Kansas City (UMKC) School of Dentistry.</p>\n<p class=\"p1\">Dr. Hunter recently got married in Kansas City, Missouri and has a large Bernese Mountain Dog named Moose.<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp; </span>In her free time, she loves hiking with her dog, skiing, and enjoying the great outdoors.<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp; </span>Dr. Hunter enjoys all aspects of general dentistry, and has a passion for helping patients with dental anxiety.<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp; </span>She can’t wait to see you and help with all of your dental needs!</p></div>",
      "id": "e1147-e8-modal",
      "text": "Hunter McAreavyDDSDr. Hunter is very excited to begin serving patients at Cosmetic & Implant Dentistry WP!  Dr. Hunter is from a small town in Missouri and recently moved back from Colorado after living there for 7 years.  She completed her Bachelor of Science from the University of Missouri, and Doctor of Dental Surgery (DDS) at the University of Missouri Kansas City (UMKC) School of Dentistry.\nDr. Hunter recently got married in Kansas City, Missouri and has a large Bernese Mountain Dog named Moose.  In her free time, she loves hiking with her dog, skiing, and enjoying the great outdoors.  Dr. Hunter enjoys all aspects of general dentistry, and has a passion for helping patients with dental anxiety.  She can’t wait to see you and help with all of your dental needs!"
    }
  ]
